<title>USA: Bando McGlocklin sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Bando McGlocklin sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PEWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bando McGlocklin Capital Corp said it declared a special dividend of about $0.50 per share, payable December 31, record December 20.</p>
<p>The dividend results from restructuring of the company as a real estate investment trust, which was approved at the annual meeting Wednesday, Bando said.</p>
<p>The special dividend replaces a quarterly dividend that traditionally was paid January 31 and is larger because the company must distribute a one-time gain, Bando said.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
